-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">EN 15038 Certification &amp; Compliance</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Full scope verification and certification for Translation Services quality requirements under EN 15038.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-check text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Comprehensive Audit &amp; Assessment</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Thorough on-site and documentation audits to evaluate your translation service quality management system.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-chalkboard-teacher text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Training &amp; Consultancy</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Expert coaching and training for your teams on EN 15038 implementation and translation quality best practices.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-headset text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase trac